doc ///
Node
  Key
    image
  Headline
    image of a map
  SeeAlso
    target
///

doc ///
  Key
    (image, Matrix)
    (image, RingElement)
  Headline
    image of a map
  Description
    Text
      @TT "image h"@ -- yields the image of the homomorphism @TT "h"@.

      The result will be a submodule of the target of h

      If h is a ring element, it is interpreted as a one by one matrix.
///
